.Dd May 29, 2026
.Dt ZTASK 1
.Os zdots
.Sh NAME
.Nm ztask
.Nd activate and complete task-scoped zdots environments
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar start
.Ar id
.Nm
.Ar done
.Nm
.Ar status
.Nm
.Ar stop
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
bridges backlog tasks to the live shell environment. Starting a task records
active work and hydrates context; completing a task can trigger capture.
.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width status
.It Cm start Ar id
Activate a task.
.It Cm done
Complete the active task.
.It Cm status
Show active task.
.It Cm stop
Deactivate task context.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width ZDOTDIR
.It Ev ZDOTDIR
Repository root.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr zmorning 1 ,
.Xr zdots-ctx 1
